<h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Reset your Wheelhouse password</h1>

<p>
  Someone asked to reset the password of the Wheelhouse account
  <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong>.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token),
        style: "display: inline-block; padding: 10px 16px; background-color: #212529; color: #ffc107; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;" %>
</p>

<p>
  The link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>,
  and stops working once you choose a new password.
</p>

<p>If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email: your password stays the same.</p>
